       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Automatic sliding door",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Before starting the measuring process, the sliding door of the measuring machine can be conveniently and easily closed pneumatically via the software and opened again once the measuring process is complete.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/9/csm_option_schiebetuer_a5040531ed.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c868",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Vibration decoupling",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>With a dead weight of approx. 650 kg and isolators, the massive vibration platform absorbs external vibration influences at the installation site. The isolators are supplied with compressed air at 6 bar.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/6/csm_option_schwingungsentkopplung_c7ed36a3e7.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c870",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Scanning probe",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For electronic tactile measurement of, for example, the back flank finish on taps. Available with probe inserts from D 0.3 mm to D 2 mm.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/c/csm_option_taster_12e2b69c45.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c872",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Measuring and testing equipment",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For periodic on-site inspection of the measuring machine and to verify the accuracy of transmitted and incident light measurements, ZOLLER offers appropriate measuring and inspection equipment for your measuring machine, such as control mandrels, diameter and angle gauges.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/9/csm_option_messmittel_39f8b82e8f.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c874",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Emergency stop circuit on the »cockpit«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Allows all motorized movements to be stopped simultaneously in order to further increase the high level of safety of the Uhing drives. The power supply to the electronic components is maintained, so there is no risk of data loss.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/f/csm_option_cockpit_c34b7fbb02.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c876",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Security package",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Important operating elements are located on the front of the measuring machine. This means you always have unrestricted access to the emergency stop switch, the reset button, the membrane keypad and the button for starting measuring processes.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/d/csm_option_sicherheitspaket_95153e17e4.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c878",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Manual RFID read/write station »mslz«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For manual writing/reading of the code carrier on the tool holder via a hand-held reader.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/f/csm_option_rfid_34dfe1d75c.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c880",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "UPS system",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The UPS system for uninterruptible power supply ensures that your computer is shut down properly in the event of a power grid fault to prevent data loss. Mains voltages of 230 V~ (Europe) and 120 V~ (USA) are available.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/2/csm_option_usv_4c4cb5d571.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c882",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c866",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
